1
00:00:00,786 --> 00:00:03,286
(Penny:)You two want to be alone?

2
00:00:03,289 --> 00:00:06,189
(Leonard:)I want you to know I get
why you don't want the money--

3
00:00:06,191 --> 00:00:07,921
(Leonard:)you've got this new job,
you're excited

4
00:00:07,927 --> 00:00:09,557
(Leonard:)about being financially
independent--

5
00:00:09,561 --> 00:00:11,561
(Leonard:)and I am nothing
but proud of you.

6
00:00:11,563 --> 00:00:12,963
(Penny:)Oh, thank you so much.

7
00:00:12,965 --> 00:00:15,035
(Penny:)It feels so good
to hear you say that.

8
00:00:15,034 --> 00:00:16,264
(Penny:)And I want you
to know

9
00:00:16,268 --> 00:00:18,098
(Penny:)that I get this job
kind of changes

10
00:00:18,103 --> 00:00:19,633
(Penny:)the balance in our relationship,

11
00:00:19,638 --> 00:00:21,908
(Penny:)and... I'm trying
to be sensitive to that.

12
00:00:24,043 --> 00:00:26,473
(Penny:)What?

13
00:00:26,478 --> 00:00:29,008
(Penny:)Well, I just think that
maybe you're a little hung up

14
00:00:29,014 --> 00:00:31,514
(Penny:)on the money because
I'm less reliant on you now,

15
00:00:31,517 --> 00:00:32,817
(Penny:)and that's a little scary.

16
00:00:33,786 --> 00:00:36,116
(Leonard:)Hmm.

17
00:00:36,121 --> 00:00:37,691
(Bernadette:)Maybe.

18
00:00:39,091 --> 00:00:42,191
Or maybe I tried
to do something nice

19
00:00:42,194 --> 00:00:44,564
(Leonard:)and maybe you had
a problem with it

20
00:00:44,563 --> 00:00:47,193
(Leonard:)because of your control issues.

21
00:00:48,801 --> 00:00:50,731
(Penny:)Control issues?

22
00:00:50,736 --> 00:00:53,506
(Bernadette:)Maybe.

23
00:00:53,505 --> 00:00:55,835
Or... maybe...

24
00:00:55,841 --> 00:00:58,041
(Penny:)now that I'm no longer
an out-of-work actress

25
00:00:58,043 --> 00:01:00,173
(Penny:)who can't pay
for her own dinner,

